:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro []
<<set $outside to 1>>
<<effects>>
<<bird_fly_reveal_wings>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You soar above the moor, searching for any prey in sight. <<GreatHawk>> and you fly and pause by turns, letting the children explore this world freely.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们在荒原上空翱翔，寻找着任何可见的猎物。<<GreatHawk>>和你时飞时停，让孩子们自由地探索这片天地。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set _helper_id to $BirdTower.scene.ids.find(id => $childRecords[id].development.trait is 'clever') ?? $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    A glinting speck catches your eye, and you land nearby and begin to search.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一个闪光的亮点吸引了你的目光，你在附近降落并开始搜索。
<</language>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childname _helper_id>> lands on the ground with you and watches you dig in the sand, then comes closer and helps you claw at the soil.
    <br>
    Before long a shiny button appears in your hand, and <<childname _helper_id>> chirps excitedly at your find.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childname _helper_id>>跟着你落在地面上，观察着你挖掘沙地，随后也凑上前用爪子帮你刨土。
    <br>
    没过多久，一枚亮晶晶的纽扣出现在你的手里，<<childname _helper_id>>对着你们的发现兴奋地唧唧叫。
<</language>>
<<set $bird.materials.junk +=1>>
<br><br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Shiny good things. <<babyhawks>> like them too." The harpy lands on a branch not far off to keep watch, looking quite pleased with your haul.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "闪亮的好东西。<<babyhawks>>也很喜欢。"哈比落在不远处的树杈上守望着，看起来对你们的收获很满意。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk lands on a branch not far off to keep watch, and lets out a loud shriek, looking quite pleased with your haul.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰落在不远处的树杈上守望着，<<bHe>>发出一声响亮的啸叫，看起来对你们的收获很满意。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 2'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 2 []
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You return to the sky and keep exploring.
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      <<babyhawks>> seem to have perked up hunting for those shiny little things. You realise this is a good chance to teach, to lead by example and show the children how to recognise and handle the common prey of the moor.
      You tell your mate the idea; <<bHe>> seems to approve, and stays at your side as you search for suitable prey.
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们回到天空中继续探索，
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      <<babyhawks>>似乎打起了精神寻找那些闪亮的小东西。你意识到这是个很好的教学机会，能以身作则教会孩子们如何辨认和对待荒原上的各种常见猎物。
      你告诉了你的配偶这个想法，<<bHe>>看起来很赞同，跟在你身边和你一同寻找合适的猎物。
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You keep an eye out for anything useful for a demonstration, and your gaze settles on an old tree. You bring <<beasttype>> and <<babyhawks>> down to the trees nearby and study which parts are useful enough.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你留意着任何能用来演示的东西，目光聚焦到一颗老树上。你带着<<beasttype>>和<<babyhawks>>降落到这附近的树上，观察着哪些部分足够有用。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You fly to the canopy and wrench off a thick branch. "Look at this — good firewood has to be this big! This thick!"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你飞向树冠掰动一根粗壮的树枝，"看好了，上好的柴火就是要这么大！这么粗！"
    <</language>>
    <<set $bird.materials.wood +=1>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You fly to the canopy and pick some healthy-looking leaves. "These soft leaves will suit <<babyhawksyou>> well."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你飞向树冠摘下一些状态不错的叶子，"这些柔软的叶片会很适合<<babyhawksyou>>的。"
    <</language>>
    <<set $bird.materials.leaves +=1>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You fly to the canopy and snap off some thick branches. "This hard wood is good for building nests."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你飞向树冠掰下一些粗大的树枝，"这种坚硬的树枝很适合用来搭建巢穴。"
    <</language>>
    <<set $bird.materials.sticks +=1>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>
    <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gt 1>>
      all
    <</if>>
    beat their wings and fly around the tree, copying you by plucking a fragile twig or two.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>
    <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gt 1>>
      纷纷
    <</if>>
    拍打翅膀绕着树飞行，学着你的样子摘下一两根脆弱的小树枝。
<</language>>
<<set $bird.materials.sticks += $BirdTower.scene.ids.length>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The harpy helps take your haul from you. "Good stuff for nesting and sharpening claws."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      哈比在一旁帮忙接过你们的收获，"筑巢和磨爪的好料子。"
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk takes your haul from you nearby and helps lighten your load.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰在一旁接过你们的收获，帮助你们减轻负担。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 3'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 3 []
<<rng 2>>
<<set _beastGen to ($rng is 1 ? "猫" : "狐狸")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You keep flying. Suddenly the grass below shakes violently, and a <<print lanSwitch(_beastGen is "猫" ? "cat" : "fox", _beastGen)>> bursts out of the undergrowth.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们继续飞行。忽然，下方的草地开始猛烈地摇晃，一只<<print _beastGen>>从草丛里钻了出来。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your harpy gives a shriek,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的哈比发出一声尖啸，
  <</language>>
  <<if _beastGen is "狐狸">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        and looks at it with disgust. "Egg thief. Stay away from them."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        厌恶地看着它。"偷蛋的家伙。离他们远点。"
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        and watches it warily. "Careful. Their claws are sharp, <<babyhawks>> are still too fragile."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        谨慎地看着它。"小心。他们的爪子很锋利，<<babyhawks>>还太脆弱。"
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your hawk gives a threatening shriek, warning your children to stay away from it.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的鹰发出一声威胁的尖啸，警告着你的孩子远离它。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The <<print lanSwitch(_beastGen is "猫" ? "cat" : "fox", _beastGen)>> is startled by the shriek. It looks up, spots you, and immediately darts into the undergrowth and flees.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<print _beastGen>>被尖啸声吓了一跳。它抬头发现你们的踪影，立刻蹿进草丛逃走了。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set _helper_id to $BirdTower.scene.ids.find(id => $childRecords[id].development.trait is 'sympathy') ?? $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childname _helper_id>> does not seem to care much for your mate's warning; <<childhe _helper_id>> beats <<childhis>> wings and tries to catch up with the <<print lanSwitch(_beastGen is "猫" ? "cat" : "fox", _beastGen)>> for a closer look, but soon loses it.
    <br>
    You soothe <<GreatHawk>> for a while before setting off again; by then <<babyhawks>> have already lost interest in the <<print lanSwitch(_beastGen is "猫" ? "cat" : "fox", _beastGen)>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childname _helper_id>>似乎不太在乎你的配偶的警告，<<childhe _helper_id>>拍打着翅膀想要追上<<print _beastGen>>仔细观察，但很快就跟丢了。
    <br>
    你安抚了<<GreatHawk>>一会儿才重新上路，期间<<babyhawks>>已经失去了对<<print _beastGen>>的兴趣。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 4'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 4 []
<<npc "Great Hawk">><<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    After that little interruption, you recall something important.
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      There is a danger on the moor that your children should never come into contact with.
    <<else>>
      You should warn your children to avoid that dangerous presence.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    经过刚刚的小插曲，你想起了一件重要的事。
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      荒原上有一种危险存在是你的孩子永远不应该接触的。
    <<else>>
      你应该警示你的孩子避开那个危险的存在。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $remy_seen is "farm" or $remy_seen is "livestock" or $livestock_intro isnot undefined>>
  <span class="red"><<lanSwitch "Remy's men." "雷米的手下。">></span>
<<else>>
  <span class="red"><<lanSwitch "Humans." "人类。">></span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You look around for traces of smoke. Thanks to your excellent eyesight, you can see
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你四处张望，寻找烟火的痕迹。有赖于你极佳的视力，你可以看见
<</language>>
<<if $daily.huntRemyAlerted>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      distant tents. Those people are moving in and out of the camp, their guard raised because of your raid today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      远方的帐篷。那些人在营地里进进出出，因你今天的侵扰提高了警戒。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $daily.huntRemyBurnt>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      distant burning tents. The thought that they will not come near your tower for the time being lets you breathe a sigh of relief.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      远方燃烧的帐篷。他们暂时不会接近你的高塔这一念头让你松了口气。
  <</language>>
  <<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      distant campfires. Those people come out of the tents holding forked metal poles and nets, looking very dangerous.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      远方的营火。那些人从帐篷里走出，手上拿着分叉的金属棍和网，看起来十分危险。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <br>
    <<your_bird_text>> has noticed them too, and <<bhe>> gives a small call to signal you.
    <br><br>
    You guide <<babyhawks>> to notice the distant sight, then turn and fly towards the tower, letting <<babyhawksthem>> follow you to a safer place to look for prey.
    <br>
    Your children seem quite curious about the rising smoke, but <<GreatHawk>> blocks <<babyhawksthem>>, using <<bhis>> body to mark the boundary of where they may go. <<bHe>> leads <<babyhawks>> to follow you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <br>
    <<your_bird_text>>也注意到了他们，<<bhe>>发出小小的鸣叫声示意。
    <br><br>
    你指引<<babyhawks>>注意远方的景象，随后转身飞向塔的方向，让<<babyhawksthem>>跟随自己到更安全的地方寻找猎物。
    <br>
    你的孩子似乎对冉冉升起的烟火相当好奇，但<<GreatHawk>>挡住了<<babyhawksthem>>，用身体划分活动区域的界限。<<bHe>>带着<<babyhawks>>跟上了你。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 5'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 5 []
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Close to the tower, you soon find a scattered group of lurkers resting in the grass.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    靠近高塔，你们很快就找到了一群零散的潜伏者，它们正在草地里休息。
<</language>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Fly high, don't let the prey see you. Fly fast, don't let the prey predict your strike." The harpy instructs, readying a surprise attack, but <<babyhawks>> only stare at the grass curiously, seemingly not listening.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "飞得高些，不要让猎物看见你。飞得快些，不要让猎物预测到你的袭击。"哈比指导着，准备发动突袭，但<<babyhawks>>只是好奇地望着草地，似乎并没有在听。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk gives a small shriek, readying a surprise attack, but <<babyhawks>> only stare at the grass curiously, seemingly not paying attention to the Great Hawk's movements.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰发出一声小小的尖鸣，准备发动突袭，但<<babyhawks>>只是好奇地望着草地，似乎并没有在注意观察巨鹰的动作。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You laugh. "Let me teach them. Think of it as checking your work on me."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你笑出了声，"让我来教吧，就当验收你对我的教学成果。"
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Let me do it. Could <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> help watch <<babyhawks>>?" you ask the Great Hawk.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "让我来吧。<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>可以帮忙看着<<babyhawks>>吗？"你请求巨鹰。
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Let me do it." You smile and reassign your roles. "<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> can watch over us."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "让我来吧。"你微笑，重新分配你们的职责，"<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>可以负责看着我们。"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<if C.npc["Great Hawk"].dom gte 50>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<GreatHawk>> hesitates, then <<= $monster ? "nods" : "calls out">>, flying higher to circle and watch over you, guarding against any possible threat.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<GreatHawk>>犹豫地<<= $monster ? "点点头" : "叫了一声">>，飞向更高处盘旋守护着你们，防卫任何可能的威胁。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<GreatHawk>> <<= $monster ? "nods" : "calls out">>, flying higher to circle and watch over you, guarding against any possible threat.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<GreatHawk>><<= $monster ? "点点头" : "叫了一声">>，飞向更高处盘旋守护着你们，防卫任何可能的威胁。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Alright, little <<childname>>," you snap your fingers at <<childname>>, which immediately draws <<childhis>> attention. "Watch me."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "好了，小<<childname>>，"你向<<childname>>打了一个响指，这立刻吸引了<<childhis>>的注意。"看着我。"
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        " <<childname>>, good child," you fly in front of <<childname>> and use short calls to draw <<childhis>> attention. "Watch me, copy what I do."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        " <<childname>>，好孩子，"你飞到<<childname>>的眼前，用短促的鸣叫吸引<<childhis>>的注意。"看着我，学习我的动作。"
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        " <<childname>>." You fly in front of <<childname>> and use short calls to draw <<childhis>> attention. "Watch me."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        " <<childname>>。"你飞到<<childname>>的眼前，用短促的鸣叫吸引<<childhis>>的注意。"看着我。"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if $dateCount.GreatHawkHunts gte 50>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      This routine is far too familiar; it is already perfectly etched into your muscle memory.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      这套流程太过熟悉，已经完美地刻在了你的肌肉记忆之中。
  <</language>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You circle high, waiting for the perfect moment. The instant the chance appears, your hunting instinct takes over. You dive down at astonishing speed, reach out and seize a lurker, then shoot back up into the clouds to your children's side.
    <br>
    The lurker struggles in your hands, but soon goes still. <<childname>> gives an excited chatter.
    <<if $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait is "clumsy">>
      <<lanSwitch "tries to snatch it from your hands." "试图从你手中抓过它。">>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch "can hardly wait to catch one itself." "迫不及待地要自己抓一只试试。">>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    "<<print speechDif(lanSwitch("Your turn now.", "现在轮到你了。"), lanSwitch("Now try it yourself.", "现在自己试试看吧。"), lanSwitch("Alright, now try it yourself.", "好了，现在自己试试看吧。"))>>"<<= $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait is "clumsy" ? "You tuck the lurker into your arms and refuse <<childhim>> with a gesture." : "You circle around <<childhim>>, encouraging your child.">>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在高处盘旋，等待完美的时机。机会一出现，你的狩猎本能就开始发挥作用。你以惊人的速度向下俯冲，伸出手抓住一只潜伏者，然后猛地攀升，飞向云层，回到你的孩子身边。
    <br>
    潜伏者在你的手里挣扎，但很快就失去了动静。<<childname>>发出兴奋的叽喳声，<<= $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait is "clumsy" ? "试图从你手中抓过它。" : "迫不及待地要自己抓一只试试。">>
    <br><br>
    "<<print speechDif("现在轮到你了。","现在自己试试看吧。","好了，现在自己试试看吧。")>>"<<= $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait is "clumsy" ? "你把潜伏者揣在怀里，用动作拒绝<<childhim>>。" : "你在<<childhim>>身边盘旋，鼓励着你的孩子。">>
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 6'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 6 []
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawks>> copy you, folding their wings and diving towards the ground, chasing the fleeing shadows of the lurkers in the grass.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>模仿着你的样子，收起翅膀向地面俯冲，追逐着草地上潜伏者逃窜的影子。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 2>>
  <<if $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait is $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait>>
      <<case "clumsy">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            They race at the lurker, reach out their talons and seize the prey, but the momentum throws them off balance and they tumble forward, rolling over in the grass. The lurker takes the chance and escapes.
            <br>
            The children right themselves, fly back up into the sky, and give frustrated cries at your side.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            他们高速冲向潜伏者，伸出爪子抓住猎物，却在惯性的影响下失去平衡往前一倒，在草地上打个了滚。潜伏者趁机逃走了。
            <br>
            孩子们调整好姿势，重新飞回天空，在你身边发出沮丧的低鸣。
        <</language>>
      <<case "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Several of the young hawks pick the same larger lurker and pin it down together.
            <br>
            They immediately start screeching and fighting over who gets it, but the prey wriggles free in the scuffle, twists its body, and slips out from under their claws.
            <br>
            The children fly back into the sky in frustration, screeching reproachfully at one another.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            几只小鹰选定了同一只个头较大的潜伏者，一并踩住了它。
            <br>
            他们立刻尖鸣着为这只潜伏者的归属争打起来，猎物却在这场角力中挣脱出去，将身一扭，反从他们的爪下逃走了。
            <br>
            孩子们懊丧地飞回天空，互相大叫埋怨着。
        <</language>>
      <<default>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            They each pick out prey and race after it. Soon the lurkers are pinned under the young hawks' claws. They grip the prey and try to climb, but the creature's struggling throws them off balance, and in the end, to avoid crashing headfirst into a rock, they have to let go of the lurkers.
            <br>
            Empty-clawed, the children fly back to your side and give a dejected cry.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            他们分别选定了猎物，高速追了过去。很快，潜伏者就被小鹰扣在爪下。他们抓着猎物试图攀升，但这个生物的挣扎让他们失去了平衡，最终为了避免一头栽到一块岩石上，他们不得不撒开手里的潜伏者。
            <br>
            两爪空空的，孩子们飞回你身边，沮丧地低鸣了一声。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        They race at the lurker, reach out their talons and seize the prey to climb, but the momentum throws them off balance. By the time they steady their flight, the lurker has already escaped.
        <br>
        Empty-clawed, the children fly back into the sky and give a dejected cry at your side.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        他们高速冲向潜伏者，伸出爪子扣住猎物准备爬升，却在惯性的影响下失去了平衡。待他们重新调整好飞行姿势，潜伏者已经趁机逃走了。
        <br>
        两爪空空，孩子们飞回天空，在你身边发出沮丧的低鸣。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait>>
    <<case "clumsy">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childhim>> races at the lurker, reaches out <<childhis>> talons and seizes the prey, but the momentum throws <<childhim>> off balance and <<childhe>> tumbles forward, rolling over in the grass. The lurker takes the chance and escapes.
          <br>
          <<childname>> rights <<childhimself>>, flies back up into the sky, and gives a frustrated cry at your side.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childhim>>高速冲向潜伏者，伸出爪子抓住猎物，却在惯性的影响下失去平衡往前一倒，在草地上打个了滚。潜伏者趁机逃走了。
          <br>
          <<childname>>调整好姿势，重新飞回天空，在你身边发出沮丧的低鸣。
      <</language>>
    <<case "dominant">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childhim>> picks out a larger lurker and pins it down with a stomp.
          <br>
          But this lurker is far too heavy; <<childhim>> struggles to lift the prey, only for it to slip from <<childhis>> claws. It twists its body and escapes from under <<childhim>>.
          <br>
          <<childname>> flies back into the sky in frustration, crying in annoyance.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childhim>>选定了一只个头较大的潜伏者，猛地踩住了它。
          <br>
          但这只潜伏者实在太沉了，<<childhim>>努力抓起猎物，却只是让潜伏者从爪中滑脱。它将身一扭，反从<<childhim>>的爪下逃走了。
          <br>
          <<childname>>懊丧地飞回天空，气恼地鸣叫着。
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>> picks out prey and races after it. Soon the lurker is pinned under <<childhis>> claws. <<childHe>> grips the prey and tries to climb, but the creature's struggling throws <<childhim>> off balance, and in the end, to avoid crashing headfirst into a rock, <<childhe>> has to let go of the lurker.
          <br>
          Empty-clawed, <<childname>> flies back to your side and gives a dejected cry.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>选定了猎物，高速追了过去。很快，潜伏者就被小鹰扣在爪下。<<childHe>>抓着猎物试图攀升，但这个生物的挣扎让<<childhim>>失去了平衡，最终为了避免一头栽到一块岩石上，<<childhe>>不得不撒开手里的潜伏者。
          <br>
          两爪空空的，<<childname>>飞回你身边，沮丧地低鸣了一声。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Lacking skill? Then train more, <<babyhawksyou>> still have a lot to learn." You pull <<babyhawks>> into a comforting embrace,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "菜，就多练，<<babyhawksyou>>还有得学呢。"你把<<babyhawks>>揽入一个安抚的怀抱，
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Well done! <<babyhawksyou>> just need more practice." You kiss <<babyhawks>> on the top of the head,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "做得很棒！<<babyhawksyou>>只需要多加练习。"你亲了亲<<babyhawks>>的头顶，
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Good work. <<babyhawksyou>> just need more practice." You stroke <<babyhawks>> on the top of the head,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "干得不错。<<babyhawksyou>>只需要多加练习。"你抚摸<<babyhawks>>的头顶，
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The harpy also descends to your side and nods approvingly.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      哈比也下降到你们身边，赞许地点了点头。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk also descends to your side and coos softly in agreement.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰也下降到你们身边，轻柔地鸣叫着附和。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You lead your mate and <<babyhawks>> down into a flower field not far away, and have <<your_bird_text>> tear the lurker apart with <<bhis>> talons and feed it to <<babyhawks>> to replenish the energy spent on the hunt.
    <br>
    <<babyhawksthem>> devour the lurker in no time, clearly having forgotten the frustration of the failed hunt.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你带着你的配偶和<<babyhawks>>在不远处的花田中落地，让<<your_bird_text>>用爪子撕碎潜伏者，喂给<<babyhawks>>来补充狩猎消耗的精力。
    <br>
    <<babyhawksthem>>飞速地吃光了这只潜伏者，显然已经忘记了狩猎失败的沮丧。
<</language>>
<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    After a short rest, you take to the sky again.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    休息片刻，你们重新飞上天空。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 7'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstHunt Intro 7 []
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You spend a long time searching for prey, teaching and practising hunting.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们花了很长时间继续寻找猎物、教学和练习捕猎。
<</language>>
<<tiredness 60>><<gggtiredness>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Your children are still young, so failed and fruitless hunts are the majority, but at least you make sure
    <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gt 1>>
      every young hawk
    <<else>>
      <<childname>>
    <</if>>
    catches a lurker.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们的孩子尚且年幼，失败和落空的狩猎总是占据多数，但你们至少确保了
    <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gt 1>>
      每只小鹰都
    <<else>>
      <<childname>>
    <</if>>
    能抓到一只潜伏者。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> seems proud of your children.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>似乎以你们的孩子为傲。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>><<gglove>>
  <br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Good hunt. <<babyhawks>> learn so fast! We go home." <<bhe>> says. You follow <<bhim>> and fly back to the hawk tower.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “好猎。<<babyhawks>>学得真快！我们回家。”<<bhe>>说。你们跟在<<bhim>>后面，飞回了鹰塔。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your <<beasttype>> seems proud of your children.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的<<beasttype>>似乎为你们的孩子感到骄傲。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>><<gglove>>
  <br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> gives a satisfied call and starts flying back to the tower. You follow <<bhim>> and return to the hawk tower.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>满意地叫了一声，开始飞回塔楼。你们跟在<<bhim>>后面，回到了鹰塔。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawks>> carry their prey back to the nest and immediately begin eating happily.
    <br>
    <<GreatHawk>> comes close to your side,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>抓着自己的猎物回到巢里，立刻开始高兴地进食。
    <br>
    <<GreatHawk>>凑到你的身边，
<</language>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      and pecks you lightly on the face.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      在你的脸上轻啄。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      and gives you a gentle peck.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      轻柔地啄了你一口。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      both sink into feeling, and
    <</if>>
    hold each other quietly for a while.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们
    <<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
      都沉浸在感慨中，
    <</if>>
    安静地拥抱了一会儿。
<</language>>
<<stress -12>><<trauma -6>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    After a moment <<bHe>> releases you and returns to the perch.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    过了一会儿，<<bHe>>放开你，回到了栖木上。
<</language>>
<<set $bird.timer to 35>>
<br><br>
<<if !$BirdTower.seen.immature>>
  <<set $BirdTower.seen.immature to true>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You put the collected materials into the pile of spoils and look around your tower with satisfaction.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你把收集到的材料放进战利品堆里，满意地环顾你的高塔。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Bird Tower Build'>>
  <<bird_pass 5>>
  <<BabyHawkStoryClean>>
  <<endevent>>
<</lanLink>>
